  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>守護機士クロアセラフ……
あれが結晶界の
戦闘兵器のパワーなのね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That Mechaknight Chlorseraph... so that's the kind of power Quartzia had at its disposal.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。我々、機械人には
使用目的によって
六つのクラスが存在する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Correct. Us mechanoids are divided into six different classes depending on our purpose.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まず、ナンバーズと呼ばれる
単純作業タイプのⅡ〜Ⅹ型</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Firstly, the II-X type, which are made for basic menial tasks, and are simply referred to by a number.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分の属する汎用ジャック型。
思念術面に特別チューンを加えた
インカローズらクィーン型</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I am classed as the general-purpose Jack type. Incarose and other Queen types excell at Will artes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人型をとらないキング型。
コランダームのように研究・管理
性能を強化したジョーカー型</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>King types do not take a humanoid form. Joker types like Corundum have enhanced research and management functions.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そして純粋に戦闘目的で
開発されたのが
クロアセラフらエース型だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And those that are developed purely for combat are Ace types, such as Chlorseraph.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>汎用型の自分が戦闘型のヤツを
撃退するなど、スペック的には
絶対に不可能なはずだが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Strictly speaking in terms of specs, it should be physically impossible for a general-purpose type such as myself to repel a hit from a combat type, however...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>不可能じゃないわよ。
だって、あなたには……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not impossible. Because you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;には……
・勇気があるじゃない
・手が余分にあるじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;, you...
・You've got courage.
・You've got extra hands.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>勇気があるじゃない。
戦闘型に立ち向かっていく
強いスピリアが！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You've got courage. A Spiria strong enough to stand up to a combat type!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『勇気』……か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Courage"...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だが、自分が恐れるのも
この制御しきれない
スピリアなのだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...However, I am afraid of this Spiria that is out of my control...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは私たちも同じよ。
スピリアを完全に制御できる
人間なんて、いやしないもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's the same for us humans too. There's no such thing as a person with complete control over their Spiria.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>手が余分にあるじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You've got extra hands.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12340</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>手が……？　意味不明。
確かにソーマ腕はあるが
その程度でヤツとの性能差は……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hands? Does not compute. It is true my Soma takes the form of arms, but the issue lies with our difference in performance...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ううん、あなたの『手』は
『私たち』よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's not it, by "hands" I mean you have "us."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>助けが必要な時は
いつでも『手』を貸すわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We'll always be there to lend you a "hand."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>例え敵が、結晶界最強の
戦闘兵器であっても、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even if it means going up against Quartzia's most powerful weapon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……了解だ。
今の言葉、自分の
メモリーに強く記録する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Understood. I will take great care to record your words and this moment in my memory.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
